INSERT INTO questions (id, category, level, parent_id, title, answer, tags, sort_order) VALUES (
  'algo-016',
  'algorithm',
  0,
  NULL,
  '反转链表?',
  '## 核心概念

反转单链表。时间O(n),空间O(1)。

## 算法原理

迭代:三个指针pre,cur,next。递归:递归到末尾后反向连接。

## 代码示例

```java
public class LinkedList {
    static class ListNode { int val; ListNode next; }
    public ListNode reverse(ListNode head) {
        ListNode prev = null, curr = head;
        while (curr != null) {
            ListNode next = curr.next;
            curr.next = prev;
            prev = curr;
            curr = next;
        }
        return prev;
    }
}
```

## 变体与延伸

链表操作相关变体。',
